  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/DUDqO4j8Yy12bxfYmHvhIDyI4dVa4AmQpmDzeF4QnSA.original.fullsize.png\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8RiNb1d4JFmi1xARSU1P0ACkgw_N6QsHeGYOVCgzzdU.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\because \\frac{16+\\alpha}{3}=6 \\text { and } \\frac{15+\\beta}{3}=6 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow(\\alpha, \\beta) \\equiv(2,3)\\end{aligned}$\nAlso, $\\mathrm{C}_1 \\mathrm{C}_2=\\mathrm{r}_1+\\mathrm{r}_2$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{(2-8)^2+\\left(3-\\frac{15}{2}\\right)^2}=2 r_2+r_2 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow r_2=\\frac{5}{2} \\Rightarrow r_1=2 r_2=5 \\\\ & \\therefore(\\alpha+\\beta)+4\\left(r_1^2+r_2^2\\right) \\\\ & =5+4\\left(\\frac{25}{4}+25\\right)=130\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
